{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01HUYznhY3fcmTo5bK4aH2iN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median 档结果总结：7 个 planned 实验全部符合 'pattern exists but model-dependent' 预期。\n  plan_016 (tail-384) 确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 分化为两组——强模型 (Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B)\n  gradual，弱模型 (DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B) sharp——'universal sharp phase transition' 降级为\n  'consistent trend with model-dependent transition characteristics'。plan_017 (cross-seed)\n  std 范围 0.4-3.5pp 证明 budget curve reproducible 但 variance 与模型强度相关。plan_019 确认\n  exception_only near-perfect calibration 跨 4 模型通用（非离群 ECE ≤ 0.01）。plan_020 确认\n  SFT 优于 frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，支持 SFT practical recommendation 但非压倒性优势。\n  plan_018 和 plan_022 提供 supporting evidence 但不升级任何 claim。plan_021 是最大风险——跨语言\n  泛化可能大幅降级。总体：Claim 1 + Claim 3 核心证据不受影响，budget curve 保留为 supporting evidence，\n  EMNLP main 有竞争力 (P≈0.35-0.45) 但 scope concern + model-dependent phase transition\n  需 strong rebuttal。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_016: Fine-grained phase transition — tail-384 × 4 models\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 是 sharp 还是 gradual\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.855\n      qwen7b_tail384_ci: [0.832, 0.877]\n      qwen7b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.6\n      qwen7b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -8.1\n      qwen7b_transition_type: gradual\n      deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.805\n      deepseek_tail384_ci: [0.781, 0.829]\n      deepseek_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 4.1\n      deepseek_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -13.4\n      deepseek_transition_type: sharp\n      qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.790\n      qwen15b_tail384_ci: [0.765, 0.815]\n      qwen15b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.4\n      qwen15b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -16.6\n      qwen15b_transition_type: sharp\n      codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.875\n      codellama13b_tail384_ci: [0.854, 0.896]\n      codellama13b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n      codellama13b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -10.0\n      codellama13b_transition_type: gradual\n      four_model_mean: 0.831\n      sharp_models_mean: 0.798\n      gradual_models_mean: 0.865\n      max_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      tail-384 处于 256→512 相变区间中段。信号来源：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾，tail-384\n      能捕获约 50-65% 的 exception 信息（vs tail-256 ~30%, tail-512 ~90%）。模型分化原因：\n      (1) 强模型（Qwen-7B CRUXEval-I 56.5%, CodeLlama-13B 13B参数）能从 partial exception\n      信息中推理出 verdict，因此 384 tokens 已显著提升——呈 gradual transition；\n      (2) 弱模型（DeepSeek CRUXEval-I 39%, Qwen-1.5B 仅 1.5B 参数）需要 near-complete\n      exception 信号才能有效利用，384 tokens 提升有限，大部分增益集中在 384→512 区间——呈 sharp\n      transition。CodeLlama 虽然 tokenizer 不同（LLaMA BPE），但其 13B 参数量补偿了 tokenizer\n      差异，在 384 tokens 处已能有效提取 diagnostic signal。DeepSeek 受限于 base model 的 trace\n      reasoning 能力（CRUXEval-I 39%），需要更完整的 exception 上下文。Qwen-1.5B 因模型容量极小，\n      loss landscape 更陡峭，384 tokens 的 noisy partial signal 难以稳定学习。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Budget Curve: tail Truncation × 4 Models (含 tail-384 新数据点)\"\n        headers: [Model, \"tail-256 (%)\", \"tail-384 (%)\", \"tail-512 (%)\", \"tail-1024 (%)\", \"tail-2048 (%)\", \"Δ(256→384)\", \"Δ(384→512)\", \"Transition\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, 78.9, 85.5, 93.6, 96.5, 97.3, \"+6.6pp\", \"+8.1pp\", Gradual]\n          - [DeepSeek-6.7B, 76.4, 80.5, 93.9, 96.5, 95.0, \"+4.1pp\", \"+13.4pp\", Sharp]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, 72.6, 79.0, 95.6, 96.6, 97.9, \"+6.4pp\", \"+16.6pp\", Sharp]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, 77.9, 87.5, 97.5, 98.2, \"collapse\", \"+9.6pp\", \"+10.0pp\", Gradual]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Budget curve figure (4-panel or overlay): x-axis = tail token budget [256, 384, 512, 1024, 2048], y-axis = accuracy (%)。4 条模型曲线，384 处标注 transition type。Gradual 模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama）曲线在 256→512 段近似线性上升；Sharp 模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）曲线在 256→384 段平缓、384→512 段陡升，呈 S 型。水平虚线标注 exception_only ceiling (99.83%)。\"\n      - \"Transition sharpness scatter: x-axis = model capability proxy (CRUXEval-I 或 param count), y-axis = Δ(384-256)/Δ(512-256) ratio (越高越 gradual)。4 点+回归线，展示 capability→gradualness 正相关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      tail-384 结果确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 是 model-dependent property。\n      两组分化模式清晰：强模型 gradual（Δ256→384 ≈ Δ384→512），弱模型 sharp（Δ384→512 >> Δ256→384）。\n      这直接影响论文 claim：不能说 'universal sharp phase transition at ~512 tokens'，需降级为\n      'consistent accuracy improvement trend with model-dependent transition characteristics:\n      stronger models show gradual onset while weaker models exhibit sharper thresholds'。\n      积极面：4-model mean (83.1%) 显著高于 tail-256 mean (76.5%)，证明 384 tokens 确实包含\n      有用信号；且所有模型在 tail-512 均达 93%+，证明 transition 终点 universal。Phase transition\n      figure 保留价值，但 discussion 必须新增 model-dependency caveat 和 transition sharpness\n      与 model capability 的相关性分析。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_017: Cross-seed budget curve — tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_seed42: 0.936\n      qwen7b_seed123: 0.924\n      qwen7b_seed456: 0.943\n      qwen7b_mean: 0.934\n      qwen7b_std_pp: 1.0\n      deepseek_seed42: 0.939\n      deepseek_seed123: 0.885\n      deepseek_seed456: 0.942\n      deepseek_mean: 0.922\n      deepseek_std_pp: 3.2\n      qwen15b_seed42: 0.956\n      qwen15b_seed123: 0.900\n      qwen15b_seed456: 0.938\n      qwen15b_mean: 0.931\n      qwen15b_std_pp: 2.9\n      codellama13b_seed42: 0.975\n      codellama13b_seed123: 0.968\n      codellama13b_seed456: 0.978\n      codellama13b_mean: 0.974\n      codellama13b_std_pp: 0.5\n      max_std_across_models_pp: 3.2\n      strong_model_avg_std_pp: 0.75\n      weak_model_avg_std_pp: 3.05\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-seed variance 反映 LoRA 初始化对 tail-512 budget 条件下的 trace learning 稳定性。\n      逻辑链：tail-512 包含足够的 exception 信息但也包含 non-diagnostic noise（loop 片段、变量\n      赋值）。强模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B）的 LoRA landscape 较平滑，不同初始化均收敛到\n      类似的 trace→verdict 映射，std < 1pp。弱模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）的 LoRA landscape\n      更 rugged：(1) DeepSeek 在 exception_only 上已显示 seed sensitivity (seed123=91.09%\n      vs seed42/456=99.33%)，tail-512 的更复杂 input 放大这一效应——某些 seed 未学到有效的\n      noise filtering，被 non-exception tokens 干扰；(2) Qwen-1.5B 参数量仅 1.5B，LoRA rank\n      相对于 total params 的比例更高，初始化影响更大。DeepSeek seed123 (88.5%) 呼应其\n      exception_only seed123 (91.09%) 的 pattern——同一 LoRA 初始化弱点在更复杂 input 下进一步暴露。\n      CodeLlama-13B std 最小 (0.5pp) 因其 13B 参数量提供最大 learning capacity，tail-512\n      的 signal 对其而言接近 trivial。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\"\n        headers: [Model, Seed42, Seed123, Seed456, Mean, Std, Band Width]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"93.6%\", \"92.4%\", \"94.3%\", \"93.4%\", \"1.0pp\", \"1.9pp\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-6.7B, \"93.9%\", \"88.5%\", \"94.2%\", \"92.2%\", \"3.2pp\", \"5.7pp\"]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, \"95.6%\", \"90.0%\", \"93.8%\", \"93.1%\", \"2.9pp\", \"5.6pp\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, \"97.5%\", \"96.8%\", \"97.8%\", \"97.4%\", \"0.5pp\", \"1.0pp\"]\n      - title: \"Strong vs Weak Model Seed Stability 对比\"\n        headers: [Group, Models, Avg Std, Avg Band Width, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Strong, \"Qwen-7B + CodeLlama-13B\", \"0.75pp\", \"1.5pp\", \"Near-deterministic: LoRA landscape smooth\"]\n          - [Weak, \"DeepSeek + Qwen-1.5B\", \"3.05pp\", \"5.7pp\", \"Seed-sensitive: LoRA landscape rugged\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Band plot: x-axis = tail token budget, y-axis = accuracy。每个模型一条中线 (mean) + shaded band (min-max across 3 seeds)。强模型 band 窄，弱模型 band 宽。在 tail-512 处用 error bar 标注 3-seed CI。\"\n      - \"Seed variance vs model capability scatter: x-axis = CRUXEval-I (或 param count log scale), y-axis = tail-512 3-seed std (pp)。4 点 + power fit，展示 capability↑ → variance↓ 趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-seed 结果确认 budget curve pattern reproducible——所有模型 3-seed mean 均在 92-97%\n      区间，transition 后 convergence 一致。但 variance 的 model-dependency 加强了论文必须\n      使用的 hedged language：不能说 'tail-512 reliably achieves >93%'，需改为 'tail-512\n      mean accuracy ≥ 92% across models, with tighter convergence on stronger models\n      (std < 1pp) and wider bands on weaker models (std 2-3pp)'。审稿人问 'single-seed\n      robustness' 时可展示此数据回应。实际价值：证明 budget curve 的 rank ordering (tail-2048 >\n      tail-1024 > tail-512 > tail-384 > tail-256) 在所有 seeds 上保持，trend 本身 robust；\n      absolute performance 的 seed sensitivity 是 LoRA training 问题而非 signal 问题——与\n      exception_only 的 seed pattern 一致 (D9)。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_018: Error analysis (no GPU)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"error_analysis_failure_modes\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"分析 exception_only/vota/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes，重点 Tier 1 vs Tier 2 差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Qwen-7B exception_only (2/1190 errors)\n      qwen_exception_only_errors: 2\n      qwen_exception_only_error_ids: [901, 905]\n      qwen_exception_only_root_cause: \"100% GeneratorExit (irreducible)\"\n      qwen_exception_only_error_direction: \"100% pass→fail false alarm\"\n      # Qwen-7B VOTA (7/1190 errors)\n      qwen_vota_errors: 7\n      qwen_vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n      qwen_vota_loop_artifact_errors: 3\n      qwen_vota_attention_dilution_errors: 2\n      qwen_vota_fail_to_pass_ratio: 0.57\n      # Qwen-7B full_trace (217/1190 errors)\n      qwen_full_trace_errors: 217\n      qwen_full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.35\n      qwen_full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.08\n      qwen_full_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.65\n      qwen_full_trace_length_correlation_r: 0.42\n      # Qwen-7B no_trace (296/1190 errors)\n      qwen_no_trace_errors: 296\n      qwen_no_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.63\n      qwen_no_trace_pass_to_fail_fraction: 0.37\n      # DeepSeek exception_only seed123 (106/1190 errors)\n      deepseek_seed123_errors: 106\n      deepseek_seed123_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.72\n      deepseek_seed123_overlap_with_qwen_irreducible: 2\n      # Cross-model error overlap (exception_only, non-outlier seeds)\n      exception_only_cross_model_jaccard: 0.85\n      full_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.15\n      no_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.25\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error analysis 揭示不同 trace 条件的 qualitatively different failure modes：\n      (1) Exception_only 的 2 个错误完全由 representation 决定（GeneratorExit 是 tracer 设计\n      缺陷，非模型不足），跨模型高度重叠（Jaccard ≈ 0.85）——说明 irreducible errors 是 data/\n      representation property 而非 model property。\n      (2) VOTA 的额外 5 个错误来自 Tier 2 组件引入的 noise：loop compression 有时产生误导性\n      摘要（3 例），Tier 2 tokens 稀释对 Tier 1 exception signal 的 attention（2 例）。这直接\n      支持 Claim 3 的 'combining tiers introduces noise' 论点。\n      (3) Full_trace 错误与 trace 长度强相关（r≈0.42）：>1500 tokens 的 trace 错误率 ~35%\n      vs <500 tokens ~8%，information overload pattern 明确。错误以 fail→pass 为主（65%），\n      说明模型在长 context 中找不到 fault signal，默认预测 majority class。\n      (4) No_trace 错误反映纯 majority class bias，无 systematic pattern。\n      (5) DeepSeek seed123 的 106 个错误集中在 fail→pass（72%），与 fail_recall=0.705 一致——\n      LoRA 初始化未学到 exception→fail 映射的关键部分，尤其对 uncommon exception types。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Error Mode Distribution by Condition (Qwen-7B)\"\n        headers: [Condition, Total Errors, \"fail→pass (%)\", \"pass→fail (%)\", Dominant Pattern]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2, \"0%\", \"100%\", \"GeneratorExit irreducible\"]\n          - [VOTA, 7, \"57%\", \"43%\", \"Tier 2 noise (loop artifacts + attention dilution)\"]\n          - [full_trace, 217, \"65%\", \"35%\", \"Information overload (length-correlated)\"]\n          - [no_trace, 296, \"63%\", \"37%\", \"Majority class bias\"]\n      - title: \"Error Rate by Trace Length (full_trace, Qwen-7B)\"\n        headers: [Length Bucket, N Samples, Errors, Error Rate, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"<500 tokens\", \"~180\", \"~14\", \"~8%\", \"Short traces: fault signal accessible\"]\n          - [\"500-1000 tokens\", \"~350\", \"~56\", \"~16%\", \"Medium: partial signal loss\"]\n          - [\"1000-1500 tokens\", \"~380\", \"~76\", \"~20%\", \"Long: significant overload\"]\n          - [\">1500 tokens\", \"~280\", \"~98\", \"~35%\", \"Very long: severe information overload\"]\n      - title: \"Cross-Model Error Overlap (Jaccard Index, exception_only non-outlier seeds)\"\n        headers: [Model Pair, Jaccard, Shared Errors, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-7B vs Qwen-1.5B\", 0.90, \"2/2 (both GeneratorExit)\", \"Same representation → same irreducible errors\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-7B vs CodeLlama-13B\", 0.80, \"2/~2.5 avg\", \"Different tokenizer but same root cause\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-7B vs DeepSeek (seed42)\", 0.22, \"2/~10\", \"DeepSeek has 8 errors vs Qwen 2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix grid (2×4): 4 conditions × Qwen-7B，展示 error direction 差异。exception_only 和 VOTA 几乎完美（极少 off-diagonal），full_trace 和 no_trace 显示 fail→pass 偏移。\"\n      - \"Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace only): x-axis = input token count, y-axis = binary correct/incorrect，加 binned error rate 趋势线。展示 information overload 的 dose-response 关系。\"\n      - \"Venn diagram: exception_only vs VOTA 错误重叠（Qwen-7B），展示 VOTA 额外错误全来自 Tier 2 noise。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis 为论文提供 3 个具体贡献：(1) 定量确认 exception_only 的 irreducible\n      error 来自 representation 而非模型（跨模型 Jaccard ≈ 0.85，跨 seed variance = 0），\n      强化 '99.83% = ceiling' 论点；(2) VOTA 的 5 个额外错误全部可归因于 Tier 2 components，\n      直接 quantify 了 'combining tiers introduces noise' (Claim 3)；(3) full_trace 错误\n      与长度的正相关（r≈0.42）是 Claim 2 information overload 假说的 direct evidence。\n      不足：error analysis 不能作为独立 contribution（审稿人视之为 expected follow-up），\n      但作为 Claim 1-3 的 supporting analysis 强化证据链。建议放在 Supplementary 或\n      Appendix，正文引用关键数字。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_019: Cross-model calibration — 4 models × exception_only\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_model_calibration_exception_only\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_019\"\n    description: \"4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型通用\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_ece: 0.0027\n      qwen7b_brier: 0.0013\n      qwen7b_accuracy: 0.9983\n      qwen15b_ece: 0.003\n      qwen15b_brier: 0.0015\n      qwen15b_accuracy: 0.9983\n      codellama13b_ece: 0.002\n      codellama13b_brier: 0.001\n      codellama13b_accuracy: 0.9983\n      deepseek_seed42_ece: 0.008\n      deepseek_seed42_brier: 0.005\n      deepseek_seed42_accuracy: 0.9933\n      deepseek_seed123_ece: 0.085\n      deepseek_seed123_brier: 0.075\n      deepseek_seed123_accuracy: 0.9109\n      four_model_nonoutlier_ece_max: 0.008\n      four_model_nonoutlier_brier_max: 0.005\n      ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_min: 21.0   # 0.171/0.008\n      ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_max: 85.5   # 0.171/0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      Calibration quality 直接跟随 accuracy：exception_only 在 3 个模型上达 99.83%（仅 2 个\n      相同错误），这些模型的 ECE/Brier 预期 near-identical——模型对 correct predictions 的 logit\n      confidence 接近 1.0，仅 2 个 misclassified samples 贡献微量 miscalibration。Qwen-7B\n      和 Qwen-1.5B 使用同系列 tokenizer，exception signal 的 token 表示相同，因此 calibration\n      差异极小。CodeLlama-13B 因 13B 参数量可能产生更 sharp 的 logit distribution，ECE 略低。\n      DeepSeek seed42 (99.33%, 8 errors) 的 ECE 较高（~0.008）因为 4× 更多 errors 意味着\n      更多 bins 有非零 gap between confidence and accuracy。DeepSeek seed123 (91.09%)\n      是 outlier——fail_recall 仅 0.705 意味着模型对大量 actual-fail 样本输出 high-confidence\n      pass 预测，造成严重 miscalibration (ECE ~0.085)。排除 seed123 outlier，4 模型 ECE\n      均 ≤ 0.008，与 no_trace ECE (0.171) 相比至少 21×-85× 改善——确认 exception signal\n      不仅提升 accuracy 还 fundamentally improves model confidence calibration 跨模型通用。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-model Calibration: exception_only\"\n        headers: [Model, Accuracy, ECE, Brier, \"ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\", Notes]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"99.83%\", 0.0027, 0.0013, \"63×\", \"3-seed confirmed; existing data\"]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, \"99.83%\", 0.003, 0.0015, \"57×\", \"Same errors as 7B (id=901,905)\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, \"99.83%\", 0.002, 0.001, \"86×\", \"Largest model → sharpest calibration\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek (seed42/456)\", \"99.33%\", 0.008, 0.005, \"21×\", \"8 errors; still excellent\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek (seed123) ⚠️\", \"91.09%\", 0.085, 0.075, \"2×\", \"LoRA outlier; severely miscalibrated\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram (4-panel): 每个模型一个 calibration curve (predicted prob vs actual frequency)。3 个非离群模型的曲线几乎与 perfect calibration 对角线重合；DeepSeek seed123 curve 偏离对角线（overconfident on pass predictions for actual-fail samples）。\"\n      - \"ECE bar chart: 4 models × exception_only + Qwen-7B no_trace/full_trace/VOTA 作对照。exception_only 的 bar 在所有模型上极短（≤0.008），no_trace bar (0.171) 显著突出。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model calibration 确认 exception signal 的 calibration 优势是 universal property\n      而非 Qwen-specific artifact。论文可 claim：'exception_only achieves near-perfect calibration\n      (ECE ≤ 0.008) across 4 architecturally distinct models, a 21-86× improvement over\n      no-trace baselines'。DeepSeek seed123 outlier 是 LoRA initialization problem 而非\n      calibration 本身的 issue——将其纳入 D9 (LoRA sensitivity) 讨论即可。关键论文价值：\n      calibration 是独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension，审稿人难以 dismiss——即使觉得 99.83%\n      可能 saturated，ECE/Brier 提供模型 'knows what it knows' 的定量证据。建议作为 Table 2\n      或 Figure 3 纳入正文（非 appendix），与 accuracy table 并列。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_020: Few-shot prompting baseline — frontier models\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"few_shot_frontier_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\"\n    expected_results:\n      # exception_only trace input\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception_only: 0.945\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception_only_ci: [0.93, 0.96]\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception_only: 0.965\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception_only_ci: [0.95, 0.98]\n      claude_0shot_exception_only: 0.935\n      claude_0shot_exception_only_ci: [0.92, 0.95]\n      claude_3shot_exception_only: 0.960\n      claude_3shot_exception_only_ci: [0.945, 0.975]\n      # no_trace input (supplementary)\n      gpt4o_3shot_no_trace: 0.835\n      claude_3shot_no_trace: 0.820\n      # SFT comparison\n      sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n      sft_advantage_vs_best_fewshot_pp: 3.3\n      sft_qwen15b_exception_only: 0.9983\n      sft_1_5b_vs_gpt4o_3shot_pp: 3.3\n      # Cost comparison (per 1190 samples)\n      gpt4o_api_cost_usd: 2.5\n      sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n      cost_ratio: 250\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4o 和 Claude 是 frontier models，zero-shot code reasoning 能力极强。给定 exception_only\n      traces，task 简化为 'if [ERROR] tags present → likely fail; if no errors → likely pass'。\n      Frontier models 0-shot 能处理大部分 cases (94-95%)，剩余 5-6% 错误来自：\n      (1) GeneratorExit 等 non-fatal exceptions（frontier models 也会被 [ERROR] tag 误导，\n      与 SFT 相同）；(2) 边界情况如 partial exceptions、多个 exception types 混合；\n      (3) 对 no_exception format marker 的不一致解读（有时将空 trace 误判为 incomplete\n      information 而非 no-fault signal）。\n      3-shot 提升 ~2pp（GPT-4o: 94.5→96.5%, Claude: 93.5→96%），exemplars 帮助建立\n      consistent decision boundary，但无法达到 SFT 水平——SFT 通过 4720 训练样本学到了\n      dataset-specific patterns（哪些 exception types always fatal, 哪些 benign），few-shot\n      的 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖这些 long-tail patterns。\n      关键发现：SFT Qwen-1.5B (1.5B params, 99.83%) 以 3.3pp 优势超越 GPT-4o 3-shot\n      (>175B params, 96.5%)——task-specific SFT 在 verdict prediction 上的参数效率是 generic\n      reasoning 的 >100×。但 3.3pp gap 在审稿人眼中可能是 'modest'——需要强调 error count\n      差异（2 vs ~42 errors, ~21× difference）和 cost 差异（250×）。\n      GPT-4o 3-shot no_trace (83.5%) vs SFT no_trace (75.1%) 的对比说明 frontier model\n      的代码理解能力可以部分替代 trace 信息——但远不如 SFT + exception_only (99.83%)。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"SFT vs Frontier Few-shot Comparison\"\n        headers: [Method, Model, Input, Accuracy, Errors/1190, \"Cost ($)\", Latency]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT, Qwen-7B, exception_only, \"99.83%\", 2, \"~$0.01\", \"~2s batch\"]\n          - [SFT, Qwen-1.5B, exception_only, \"99.83%\", 2, \"~$0.005\", \"~1s batch\"]\n          - [3-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, \"96.5%\", \"~42\", \"~$2.50\", \"~15min serial\"]\n          - [3-shot, Claude, exception_only, \"96.0%\", \"~48\", \"~$3.00\", \"~18min serial\"]\n          - [0-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, \"94.5%\", \"~65\", \"~$1.80\", \"~12min serial\"]\n          - [0-shot, Claude, exception_only, \"93.5%\", \"~77\", \"~$2.20\", \"~14min serial\"]\n          - [3-shot, GPT-4o, no_trace, \"83.5%\", \"~196\", \"~$1.20\", \"~10min serial\"]\n      - title: \"Base Model Zero-shot vs Frontier Few-shot (contextualization)\"\n        headers: [Model, Params, 0-shot, 3-shot, SFT, \"SFT Δ vs 3-shot\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, 1.5B, \"93.45%\", \"—\", \"99.83%\", \"+6.4pp\"]\n          - [Qwen-7B, 7B, \"89.08%\", \"90.84%\", \"99.83%\", \"+9.0pp\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-7B, 6.7B, \"90.59%\", \"—\", \"99.33%\", \"+8.7pp\"]\n          - [GPT-4o, \">175B\", \"94.5%\", \"96.5%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Claude, \">175B\", \"93.5%\", \"96.0%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by method (SFT exception_only × 4 models, 0-shot × 5 models, 3-shot × 2 frontier models)。SFT bars 在 99%+ 区域，few-shot bars 在 90-97% 区域，清晰展示 SFT advantage。\"\n      - \"Cost-accuracy Pareto plot: x-axis = log(cost per 1190 samples), y-axis = accuracy。SFT 在左上角 (low cost, high accuracy), frontier few-shot 在右下 (high cost, lower accuracy)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Few-shot baseline 确认两个论文论点：(1) SFT exception_only 在 verdict task 上超越\n      frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，证明 task-specific fine-tuning 的价值——尤其 1.5B SFT\n      model 超越 >175B GPT-4o 的 result 有很强 narrative appeal；(2) 即使 frontier model\n      也从 exception traces 获益 (no_trace 83.5% → exception_only 96.5%, +13pp)，independent\n      confirm Claim 2 的 information density 论点。但 median 档下 gap 仅 3.3pp，审稿人可能\n      argue 'the gap is not practically significant given the cost of SFT'。Rebuttal：\n      (a) error count 差异是 21×（2 vs 42），在 safety-critical 场景下差异巨大；\n      (b) SFT inference cost 是 few-shot 的 1/250；(c) SFT model 可 offline deploy 无需\n      API access。建议作为 Section 5 的 comparison table 纳入正文，定位为 'SFT as practical\n      deployment recommendation' 而非 'SFT is fundamentally superior'。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_021: OOD generalization — cross-language traces\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ood_generalization_cross_language\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Python OOD (different projects, not HumanEval/MBPP)\n      python_ood_exception_only_accuracy: 0.965\n      python_ood_exception_only_ci: [0.945, 0.980]\n      python_ood_degradation_vs_id_pp: 3.3\n      # Java traces\n      java_exception_only_accuracy: 0.920\n      java_exception_only_ci: [0.895, 0.945]\n      java_degradation_vs_id_pp: 7.8\n      # JavaScript traces\n      javascript_exception_only_accuracy: 0.905\n      javascript_exception_only_ci: [0.875, 0.930]\n      javascript_degradation_vs_id_pp: 9.3\n      # Cross-language mean\n      cross_language_mean_accuracy: 0.930\n      cross_language_mean_degradation_pp: 6.8\n      # Baseline comparisons on OOD\n      python_ood_no_trace_accuracy: 0.720\n      java_no_trace_accuracy: 0.680\n      javascript_no_trace_accuracy: 0.670\n      exception_only_lift_over_no_trace_ood_mean_pp: 24.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Exception_only 的 OOD generalization 依赖于 exception signal 的 cross-language\n      structural similarity。核心假设：[ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer\n      output 的 design choice，不是 language-inherent property——但不同语言的 exception\n      type naming 和 error message conventions 不同，导致 distribution shift。\n      Python OOD (96.5%)：同语言不同项目，exception types（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError）\n      与训练集分布相似，仅 project-specific custom exceptions 造成少量降级。3.3pp degradation\n      主要来自 (1) 训练集未见过的 custom exception classes, (2) 不同项目的 test structure\n      差异（多文件、fixtures）。\n      Java (92.0%)：exception structure 类似（try-catch, stack traces）但 exception type\n      names 不同（NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等 Java-specific names\n      训练集中未出现）。模型仍能利用 [ERROR] tag 的 binary signal，但对 exception type 的\n      fine-grained 理解降级。7.8pp degradation。\n      JavaScript (90.5%)：最大降级。JS 的 error handling 差异更大（Promise rejection, TypeError\n      in async context），且 error message format 与 Python 差异最大。但 [ERROR] tag 的\n      presence/absence signal 仍 partially transferable。9.3pp degradation。\n      所有语言上 exception_only 仍大幅优于 no_trace（mean lift 24.3pp），证明 exception\n      signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 robust，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"OOD Generalization: exception_only across Languages\"\n        headers: [Language, Setting, exception_only, no_trace, Lift, \"Degradation vs in-domain\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Python, In-domain (HumanEval+MBPP), \"99.83%\", \"75.1%\", \"+24.7pp\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [Python, OOD (new projects), \"96.5%\", \"72.0%\", \"+24.5pp\", \"-3.3pp\"]\n          - [Java, OOD, \"92.0%\", \"68.0%\", \"+24.0pp\", \"-7.8pp\"]\n          - [JavaScript, OOD, \"90.5%\", \"67.0%\", \"+23.5pp\", \"-9.3pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: languages × conditions (exception_only vs no_trace)。每种语言两个 bar，展示 exception_only 的 lift 在 OOD 上保持稳定 (~24pp)，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\"\n      - \"Degradation waterfall: in-domain → Python OOD → Java → JavaScript，展示 progressive degradation 但 floor 仍 >90%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 结果是 median 档最大风险实验。Python OOD 降级温和 (3.3pp) 支持 generalization\n      claim。Java/JavaScript 降级更大 (8-9pp) 但 (1) 仍优于所有 baseline conditions，\n      (2) lift over no_trace 保持稳定 (~24pp)——说明 exception signal 的 fault detection\n      value 跨语言 transferable，但 absolute accuracy 受 token-level distribution shift\n      影响。论文 framing：'exception_only generalizes within-language with minimal degradation\n      (3pp) and cross-language with moderate degradation (8-9pp); the diagnostic signal\n      advantage is preserved (24pp lift) regardless of language'。审稿人可能 argue\n      'Java/JS 降 8-9pp 说明 signal 不是 truly language-agnostic'——rebuttal：降级来自\n      exception type vocabulary shift 而非 signal mechanism change；用 language-mixed\n      training 可恢复。此实验的最大价值：如果完成，将 single-task concern 从 1 task → 1 task\n      多语言，部分回应 scope criticism。风险：如果 Java/JS 降到 <85%，narrative 受损。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_022: Training dynamics — learning curve comparison\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"training_dynamics_learning_curves\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 每 50 steps eval，分析收敛速度差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      # exception_only convergence\n      exception_only_steps_to_90pct: 30\n      exception_only_steps_to_95pct: 50\n      exception_only_steps_to_99pct: 120\n      exception_only_final_accuracy: 0.9983\n      exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n      # VOTA convergence\n      vota_steps_to_90pct: 60\n      vota_steps_to_95pct: 100\n      vota_steps_to_99pct: 180\n      vota_final_accuracy: 0.9941\n      vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n      # full_trace convergence\n      full_trace_steps_to_80pct: 150\n      full_trace_peak_accuracy: 0.830\n      full_trace_peak_step: 200\n      full_trace_final_accuracy: 0.8176\n      full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_with_dip\n      # no_trace convergence\n      no_trace_steps_to_73pct: 80\n      no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n      no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n      # Relative speed ratios\n      speed_ratio_exception_vs_vota_to_95pct: 2.0\n      speed_ratio_exception_vs_full_trace_to_80pct: 5.0\n      # Convergence efficiency\n      exception_only_samples_per_pp_gain: 8.5\n      full_trace_samples_per_pp_gain: 72.0\n      efficiency_ratio: 8.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency 的影响。\n      Exception_only 收敛最快（~50 steps to 95%）因为：(1) input 极短（平均 <100 tokens），\n      gradient 完全集中在 verdict-relevant signal 上；(2) 有效 unique 样本仅 2858，但 signal\n      的 binary structure（有 exception → fail，无 exception → pass）极其 learnable，少量\n      样本即可学会；(3) 无 noise tokens 干扰，每一步训练都是 effective update。\n      Full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：(1) 长 input（mean ~2000 tokens）导致 gradient\n      dilution——大部分 gradient 流向 trace token 预测而非 verdict signal；(2) epoch1 peak\n      (83.0%) 后 epoch2 下降 (76.3%) 说明模型 overfits to trace patterns 而非 verdict\n      signal；(3) epoch3 partial recovery (81.76%) 可能是 overfitting 的 random fluctuation\n      而非 systematic learning。\n      VOTA 介于两者之间：input 长度中等，包含 Tier 1 + Tier 2 信号，前者快速学习，后者需要\n      更多 steps 但不会严重干扰。\n      No_trace 快速饱和在低水平（~75%），因为无 trace 信号可学习，模型只能学习 code→verdict\n      的弱统计相关性。\n      Convergence efficiency ratio (~8.5×) 是 information density 假说的 direct quantification：\n      exception_only 每 pp gain 需要 ~8.5 training samples，full_trace 需要 ~72——验证\n      'denser signal → faster learning' 的因果链。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Convergence Milestones (steps to reach accuracy threshold)\"\n        headers: [Condition, \"To 80%\", \"To 90%\", \"To 95%\", \"To 99%\", \"Final\", Shape]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, \"~20\", \"~30\", \"~50\", \"~120\", \"99.83%\", \"Rapid saturation\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~30\", \"~60\", \"~100\", \"~180\", \"99.41%\", \"Moderate saturation\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~150\", \"never\", \"never\", \"never\", \"81.76%\", \"Non-monotonic\"]\n          - [no_trace, \"never\", \"never\", \"never\", \"never\", \"75.13%\", \"Low-ceiling plateau\"]\n      - title: \"Learning Efficiency Comparison\"\n        headers: [Condition, \"Effective unique samples\", \"Final lift (pp)\", \"Samples per pp\", Efficiency]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2858, 24.7, 8.5, \"1.0× (reference)\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~5800\", 24.3, 17.5, \"0.49×\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~5800\", 6.6, 71.8, \"0.12×\"]\n          - [no_trace, \"~5800\", 3.6, 131.7, \"0.06×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot (main figure): x-axis = training steps, y-axis = eval accuracy (%)。4 条 curves 用不同颜色/线型。exception_only 陡升后 flat（红色实线），VOTA 次之（蓝色实线），full_trace non-monotonic（绿色虚线），no_trace 低 plateau（灰色点线）。水平虚线标注 majority baseline (71.5%)。每 50 steps 一个评估点。\"\n      - \"Convergence speed bar chart: 4 conditions × steps to reach 90% (或 condition-specific ceiling 的 90%)，直观对比 learning speed。exception_only bar 最短。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 (information density) 提供 process-level evidence，补充\n      已有的 outcome-level evidence (accuracy comparison)。Key narrative：exception_only\n      不仅最终 accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也最高——8.5× faster per-pp-gain than\n      full_trace，直接量化了 information density 的 learning advantage。full_trace 的\n      non-monotonic curve（epoch2 dip）进一步说明 information overload 不仅限制 ceiling，\n      还 destabilize training——与 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling) 呼应。\n      论文价值：作为 Figure 4 或 Supplementary Figure，与 budget curve (plan_016) 形成\n      互补——budget curve 展示 'how much trace to include'，training dynamics 展示 'how\n      efficiently different signals are learned'。不作独立 contribution，但作为 Claim 2\n      的 converging evidence 有价值。审稿人可能问 'is this just because exception_only\n      has shorter sequences?'——answer：shorter sequences + diagnostic signal concentration，\n      两者 confounded 但都支持 information density narrative。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41411,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41411},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e268a169-9390-4bcd-a3c2-7ca64c8e09ca","uuid":"1ce0b501-1347-48cf-b77b-d0798915c152"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":567474,"duration_api_ms":568833,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Median 档结果总结：7 个 planned 实验全部符合 'pattern exists but model-dependent' 预期。\n  plan_016 (tail-384) 确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 分化为两组——强模型 (Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B)\n  gradual，弱模型 (DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B) sharp——'universal sharp phase transition' 降级为\n  'consistent trend with model-dependent transition characteristics'。plan_017 (cross-seed)\n  std 范围 0.4-3.5pp 证明 budget curve reproducible 但 variance 与模型强度相关。plan_019 确认\n  exception_only near-perfect calibration 跨 4 模型通用（非离群 ECE ≤ 0.01）。plan_020 确认\n  SFT 优于 frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，支持 SFT practical recommendation 但非压倒性优势。\n  plan_018 和 plan_022 提供 supporting evidence 但不升级任何 claim。plan_021 是最大风险——跨语言\n  泛化可能大幅降级。总体：Claim 1 + Claim 3 核心证据不受影响，budget curve 保留为 supporting evidence，\n  EMNLP main 有竞争力 (P≈0.35-0.45) 但 scope concern + model-dependent phase transition\n  需 strong rebuttal。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_016: Fine-grained phase transition — tail-384 × 4 models\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"fine_grained_phase_transition_tail384\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"tail-384 × 4 模型，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 是 sharp 还是 gradual\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_tail384_accuracy: 0.855\n      qwen7b_tail384_ci: [0.832, 0.877]\n      qwen7b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.6\n      qwen7b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -8.1\n      qwen7b_transition_type: gradual\n      deepseek_tail384_accuracy: 0.805\n      deepseek_tail384_ci: [0.781, 0.829]\n      deepseek_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 4.1\n      deepseek_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -13.4\n      deepseek_transition_type: sharp\n      qwen15b_tail384_accuracy: 0.790\n      qwen15b_tail384_ci: [0.765, 0.815]\n      qwen15b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 6.4\n      qwen15b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -16.6\n      qwen15b_transition_type: sharp\n      codellama13b_tail384_accuracy: 0.875\n      codellama13b_tail384_ci: [0.854, 0.896]\n      codellama13b_delta_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n      codellama13b_delta_vs_tail512_pp: -10.0\n      codellama13b_transition_type: gradual\n      four_model_mean: 0.831\n      sharp_models_mean: 0.798\n      gradual_models_mean: 0.865\n      max_diff_vs_tail256_pp: 9.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      tail-384 处于 256→512 相变区间中段。信号来源：exception events 集中在 trace 末尾，tail-384\n      能捕获约 50-65% 的 exception 信息（vs tail-256 ~30%, tail-512 ~90%）。模型分化原因：\n      (1) 强模型（Qwen-7B CRUXEval-I 56.5%, CodeLlama-13B 13B参数）能从 partial exception\n      信息中推理出 verdict，因此 384 tokens 已显著提升——呈 gradual transition；\n      (2) 弱模型（DeepSeek CRUXEval-I 39%, Qwen-1.5B 仅 1.5B 参数）需要 near-complete\n      exception 信号才能有效利用，384 tokens 提升有限，大部分增益集中在 384→512 区间——呈 sharp\n      transition。CodeLlama 虽然 tokenizer 不同（LLaMA BPE），但其 13B 参数量补偿了 tokenizer\n      差异，在 384 tokens 处已能有效提取 diagnostic signal。DeepSeek 受限于 base model 的 trace\n      reasoning 能力（CRUXEval-I 39%），需要更完整的 exception 上下文。Qwen-1.5B 因模型容量极小，\n      loss landscape 更陡峭，384 tokens 的 noisy partial signal 难以稳定学习。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Budget Curve: tail Truncation × 4 Models (含 tail-384 新数据点)\"\n        headers: [Model, \"tail-256 (%)\", \"tail-384 (%)\", \"tail-512 (%)\", \"tail-1024 (%)\", \"tail-2048 (%)\", \"Δ(256→384)\", \"Δ(384→512)\", \"Transition\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, 78.9, 85.5, 93.6, 96.5, 97.3, \"+6.6pp\", \"+8.1pp\", Gradual]\n          - [DeepSeek-6.7B, 76.4, 80.5, 93.9, 96.5, 95.0, \"+4.1pp\", \"+13.4pp\", Sharp]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, 72.6, 79.0, 95.6, 96.6, 97.9, \"+6.4pp\", \"+16.6pp\", Sharp]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, 77.9, 87.5, 97.5, 98.2, \"collapse\", \"+9.6pp\", \"+10.0pp\", Gradual]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Budget curve figure (4-panel or overlay): x-axis = tail token budget [256, 384, 512, 1024, 2048], y-axis = accuracy (%)。4 条模型曲线，384 处标注 transition type。Gradual 模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama）曲线在 256→512 段近似线性上升；Sharp 模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）曲线在 256→384 段平缓、384→512 段陡升，呈 S 型。水平虚线标注 exception_only ceiling (99.83%)。\"\n      - \"Transition sharpness scatter: x-axis = model capability proxy (CRUXEval-I 或 param count), y-axis = Δ(384-256)/Δ(512-256) ratio (越高越 gradual)。4 点+回归线，展示 capability→gradualness 正相关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      tail-384 结果确认 phase transition 存在但 sharpness 是 model-dependent property。\n      两组分化模式清晰：强模型 gradual（Δ256→384 ≈ Δ384→512），弱模型 sharp（Δ384→512 >> Δ256→384）。\n      这直接影响论文 claim：不能说 'universal sharp phase transition at ~512 tokens'，需降级为\n      'consistent accuracy improvement trend with model-dependent transition characteristics:\n      stronger models show gradual onset while weaker models exhibit sharper thresholds'。\n      积极面：4-model mean (83.1%) 显著高于 tail-256 mean (76.5%)，证明 384 tokens 确实包含\n      有用信号；且所有模型在 tail-512 均达 93%+，证明 transition 终点 universal。Phase transition\n      figure 保留价值，但 discussion 必须新增 model-dependency caveat 和 transition sharpness\n      与 model capability 的相关性分析。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_017: Cross-seed budget curve — tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_seed_budget_curve_tail512\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_017\"\n    description: \"tail-512 × 4 models × 3 seeds，验证 phase transition 后 convergence band robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_seed42: 0.936\n      qwen7b_seed123: 0.924\n      qwen7b_seed456: 0.943\n      qwen7b_mean: 0.934\n      qwen7b_std_pp: 1.0\n      deepseek_seed42: 0.939\n      deepseek_seed123: 0.885\n      deepseek_seed456: 0.942\n      deepseek_mean: 0.922\n      deepseek_std_pp: 3.2\n      qwen15b_seed42: 0.956\n      qwen15b_seed123: 0.900\n      qwen15b_seed456: 0.938\n      qwen15b_mean: 0.931\n      qwen15b_std_pp: 2.9\n      codellama13b_seed42: 0.975\n      codellama13b_seed123: 0.968\n      codellama13b_seed456: 0.978\n      codellama13b_mean: 0.974\n      codellama13b_std_pp: 0.5\n      max_std_across_models_pp: 3.2\n      strong_model_avg_std_pp: 0.75\n      weak_model_avg_std_pp: 3.05\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-seed variance 反映 LoRA 初始化对 tail-512 budget 条件下的 trace learning 稳定性。\n      逻辑链：tail-512 包含足够的 exception 信息但也包含 non-diagnostic noise（loop 片段、变量\n      赋值）。强模型（Qwen-7B, CodeLlama-13B）的 LoRA landscape 较平滑，不同初始化均收敛到\n      类似的 trace→verdict 映射，std < 1pp。弱模型（DeepSeek, Qwen-1.5B）的 LoRA landscape\n      更 rugged：(1) DeepSeek 在 exception_only 上已显示 seed sensitivity (seed123=91.09%\n      vs seed42/456=99.33%)，tail-512 的更复杂 input 放大这一效应——某些 seed 未学到有效的\n      noise filtering，被 non-exception tokens 干扰；(2) Qwen-1.5B 参数量仅 1.5B，LoRA rank\n      相对于 total params 的比例更高，初始化影响更大。DeepSeek seed123 (88.5%) 呼应其\n      exception_only seed123 (91.09%) 的 pattern——同一 LoRA 初始化弱点在更复杂 input 下进一步暴露。\n      CodeLlama-13B std 最小 (0.5pp) 因其 13B 参数量提供最大 learning capacity，tail-512\n      的 signal 对其而言接近 trivial。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-seed tail-512 Robustness (3 seeds × 4 models)\"\n        headers: [Model, Seed42, Seed123, Seed456, Mean, Std, Band Width]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"93.6%\", \"92.4%\", \"94.3%\", \"93.4%\", \"1.0pp\", \"1.9pp\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-6.7B, \"93.9%\", \"88.5%\", \"94.2%\", \"92.2%\", \"3.2pp\", \"5.7pp\"]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, \"95.6%\", \"90.0%\", \"93.8%\", \"93.1%\", \"2.9pp\", \"5.6pp\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, \"97.5%\", \"96.8%\", \"97.8%\", \"97.4%\", \"0.5pp\", \"1.0pp\"]\n      - title: \"Strong vs Weak Model Seed Stability 对比\"\n        headers: [Group, Models, Avg Std, Avg Band Width, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Strong, \"Qwen-7B + CodeLlama-13B\", \"0.75pp\", \"1.5pp\", \"Near-deterministic: LoRA landscape smooth\"]\n          - [Weak, \"DeepSeek + Qwen-1.5B\", \"3.05pp\", \"5.7pp\", \"Seed-sensitive: LoRA landscape rugged\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Band plot: x-axis = tail token budget, y-axis = accuracy。每个模型一条中线 (mean) + shaded band (min-max across 3 seeds)。强模型 band 窄，弱模型 band 宽。在 tail-512 处用 error bar 标注 3-seed CI。\"\n      - \"Seed variance vs model capability scatter: x-axis = CRUXEval-I (或 param count log scale), y-axis = tail-512 3-seed std (pp)。4 点 + power fit，展示 capability↑ → variance↓ 趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-seed 结果确认 budget curve pattern reproducible——所有模型 3-seed mean 均在 92-97%\n      区间，transition 后 convergence 一致。但 variance 的 model-dependency 加强了论文必须\n      使用的 hedged language：不能说 'tail-512 reliably achieves >93%'，需改为 'tail-512\n      mean accuracy ≥ 92% across models, with tighter convergence on stronger models\n      (std < 1pp) and wider bands on weaker models (std 2-3pp)'。审稿人问 'single-seed\n      robustness' 时可展示此数据回应。实际价值：证明 budget curve 的 rank ordering (tail-2048 >\n      tail-1024 > tail-512 > tail-384 > tail-256) 在所有 seeds 上保持，trend 本身 robust；\n      absolute performance 的 seed sensitivity 是 LoRA training 问题而非 signal 问题——与\n      exception_only 的 seed pattern 一致 (D9)。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_018: Error analysis (no GPU)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"error_analysis_failure_modes\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018\"\n    description: \"分析 exception_only/vota/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes，重点 Tier 1 vs Tier 2 差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Qwen-7B exception_only (2/1190 errors)\n      qwen_exception_only_errors: 2\n      qwen_exception_only_error_ids: [901, 905]\n      qwen_exception_only_root_cause: \"100% GeneratorExit (irreducible)\"\n      qwen_exception_only_error_direction: \"100% pass→fail false alarm\"\n      # Qwen-7B VOTA (7/1190 errors)\n      qwen_vota_errors: 7\n      qwen_vota_overlap_with_exception: 2\n      qwen_vota_loop_artifact_errors: 3\n      qwen_vota_attention_dilution_errors: 2\n      qwen_vota_fail_to_pass_ratio: 0.57\n      # Qwen-7B full_trace (217/1190 errors)\n      qwen_full_trace_errors: 217\n      qwen_full_trace_long_trace_error_rate: 0.35\n      qwen_full_trace_short_trace_error_rate: 0.08\n      qwen_full_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.65\n      qwen_full_trace_length_correlation_r: 0.42\n      # Qwen-7B no_trace (296/1190 errors)\n      qwen_no_trace_errors: 296\n      qwen_no_trace_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.63\n      qwen_no_trace_pass_to_fail_fraction: 0.37\n      # DeepSeek exception_only seed123 (106/1190 errors)\n      deepseek_seed123_errors: 106\n      deepseek_seed123_fail_to_pass_fraction: 0.72\n      deepseek_seed123_overlap_with_qwen_irreducible: 2\n      # Cross-model error overlap (exception_only, non-outlier seeds)\n      exception_only_cross_model_jaccard: 0.85\n      full_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.15\n      no_trace_cross_model_jaccard: 0.25\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error analysis 揭示不同 trace 条件的 qualitatively different failure modes：\n      (1) Exception_only 的 2 个错误完全由 representation 决定（GeneratorExit 是 tracer 设计\n      缺陷，非模型不足），跨模型高度重叠（Jaccard ≈ 0.85）——说明 irreducible errors 是 data/\n      representation property 而非 model property。\n      (2) VOTA 的额外 5 个错误来自 Tier 2 组件引入的 noise：loop compression 有时产生误导性\n      摘要（3 例），Tier 2 tokens 稀释对 Tier 1 exception signal 的 attention（2 例）。这直接\n      支持 Claim 3 的 'combining tiers introduces noise' 论点。\n      (3) Full_trace 错误与 trace 长度强相关（r≈0.42）：>1500 tokens 的 trace 错误率 ~35%\n      vs <500 tokens ~8%，information overload pattern 明确。错误以 fail→pass 为主（65%），\n      说明模型在长 context 中找不到 fault signal，默认预测 majority class。\n      (4) No_trace 错误反映纯 majority class bias，无 systematic pattern。\n      (5) DeepSeek seed123 的 106 个错误集中在 fail→pass（72%），与 fail_recall=0.705 一致——\n      LoRA 初始化未学到 exception→fail 映射的关键部分，尤其对 uncommon exception types。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Error Mode Distribution by Condition (Qwen-7B)\"\n        headers: [Condition, Total Errors, \"fail→pass (%)\", \"pass→fail (%)\", Dominant Pattern]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2, \"0%\", \"100%\", \"GeneratorExit irreducible\"]\n          - [VOTA, 7, \"57%\", \"43%\", \"Tier 2 noise (loop artifacts + attention dilution)\"]\n          - [full_trace, 217, \"65%\", \"35%\", \"Information overload (length-correlated)\"]\n          - [no_trace, 296, \"63%\", \"37%\", \"Majority class bias\"]\n      - title: \"Error Rate by Trace Length (full_trace, Qwen-7B)\"\n        headers: [Length Bucket, N Samples, Errors, Error Rate, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"<500 tokens\", \"~180\", \"~14\", \"~8%\", \"Short traces: fault signal accessible\"]\n          - [\"500-1000 tokens\", \"~350\", \"~56\", \"~16%\", \"Medium: partial signal loss\"]\n          - [\"1000-1500 tokens\", \"~380\", \"~76\", \"~20%\", \"Long: significant overload\"]\n          - [\">1500 tokens\", \"~280\", \"~98\", \"~35%\", \"Very long: severe information overload\"]\n      - title: \"Cross-Model Error Overlap (Jaccard Index, exception_only non-outlier seeds)\"\n        headers: [Model Pair, Jaccard, Shared Errors, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-7B vs Qwen-1.5B\", 0.90, \"2/2 (both GeneratorExit)\", \"Same representation → same irreducible errors\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-7B vs CodeLlama-13B\", 0.80, \"2/~2.5 avg\", \"Different tokenizer but same root cause\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-7B vs DeepSeek (seed42)\", 0.22, \"2/~10\", \"DeepSeek has 8 errors vs Qwen 2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix grid (2×4): 4 conditions × Qwen-7B，展示 error direction 差异。exception_only 和 VOTA 几乎完美（极少 off-diagonal），full_trace 和 no_trace 显示 fail→pass 偏移。\"\n      - \"Error rate vs trace length scatter (full_trace only): x-axis = input token count, y-axis = binary correct/incorrect，加 binned error rate 趋势线。展示 information overload 的 dose-response 关系。\"\n      - \"Venn diagram: exception_only vs VOTA 错误重叠（Qwen-7B），展示 VOTA 额外错误全来自 Tier 2 noise。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error analysis 为论文提供 3 个具体贡献：(1) 定量确认 exception_only 的 irreducible\n      error 来自 representation 而非模型（跨模型 Jaccard ≈ 0.85，跨 seed variance = 0），\n      强化 '99.83% = ceiling' 论点；(2) VOTA 的 5 个额外错误全部可归因于 Tier 2 components，\n      直接 quantify 了 'combining tiers introduces noise' (Claim 3)；(3) full_trace 错误\n      与长度的正相关（r≈0.42）是 Claim 2 information overload 假说的 direct evidence。\n      不足：error analysis 不能作为独立 contribution（审稿人视之为 expected follow-up），\n      但作为 Claim 1-3 的 supporting analysis 强化证据链。建议放在 Supplementary 或\n      Appendix，正文引用关键数字。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_019: Cross-model calibration — 4 models × exception_only\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"cross_model_calibration_exception_only\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_019\"\n    description: \"4 models × exception_only ECE/Brier 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型通用\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen7b_ece: 0.0027\n      qwen7b_brier: 0.0013\n      qwen7b_accuracy: 0.9983\n      qwen15b_ece: 0.003\n      qwen15b_brier: 0.0015\n      qwen15b_accuracy: 0.9983\n      codellama13b_ece: 0.002\n      codellama13b_brier: 0.001\n      codellama13b_accuracy: 0.9983\n      deepseek_seed42_ece: 0.008\n      deepseek_seed42_brier: 0.005\n      deepseek_seed42_accuracy: 0.9933\n      deepseek_seed123_ece: 0.085\n      deepseek_seed123_brier: 0.075\n      deepseek_seed123_accuracy: 0.9109\n      four_model_nonoutlier_ece_max: 0.008\n      four_model_nonoutlier_brier_max: 0.005\n      ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_min: 21.0   # 0.171/0.008\n      ece_ratio_vs_no_trace_max: 85.5   # 0.171/0.002\n    result_rationale: >\n      Calibration quality 直接跟随 accuracy：exception_only 在 3 个模型上达 99.83%（仅 2 个\n      相同错误），这些模型的 ECE/Brier 预期 near-identical——模型对 correct predictions 的 logit\n      confidence 接近 1.0，仅 2 个 misclassified samples 贡献微量 miscalibration。Qwen-7B\n      和 Qwen-1.5B 使用同系列 tokenizer，exception signal 的 token 表示相同，因此 calibration\n      差异极小。CodeLlama-13B 因 13B 参数量可能产生更 sharp 的 logit distribution，ECE 略低。\n      DeepSeek seed42 (99.33%, 8 errors) 的 ECE 较高（~0.008）因为 4× 更多 errors 意味着\n      更多 bins 有非零 gap between confidence and accuracy。DeepSeek seed123 (91.09%)\n      是 outlier——fail_recall 仅 0.705 意味着模型对大量 actual-fail 样本输出 high-confidence\n      pass 预测，造成严重 miscalibration (ECE ~0.085)。排除 seed123 outlier，4 模型 ECE\n      均 ≤ 0.008，与 no_trace ECE (0.171) 相比至少 21×-85× 改善——确认 exception signal\n      不仅提升 accuracy 还 fundamentally improves model confidence calibration 跨模型通用。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-model Calibration: exception_only\"\n        headers: [Model, Accuracy, ECE, Brier, \"ECE ratio vs no_trace (0.171)\", Notes]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"99.83%\", 0.0027, 0.0013, \"63×\", \"3-seed confirmed; existing data\"]\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, \"99.83%\", 0.003, 0.0015, \"57×\", \"Same errors as 7B (id=901,905)\"]\n          - [CodeLlama-13B, \"99.83%\", 0.002, 0.001, \"86×\", \"Largest model → sharpest calibration\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek (seed42/456)\", \"99.33%\", 0.008, 0.005, \"21×\", \"8 errors; still excellent\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek (seed123) ⚠️\", \"91.09%\", 0.085, 0.075, \"2×\", \"LoRA outlier; severely miscalibrated\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Reliability diagram (4-panel): 每个模型一个 calibration curve (predicted prob vs actual frequency)。3 个非离群模型的曲线几乎与 perfect calibration 对角线重合；DeepSeek seed123 curve 偏离对角线（overconfident on pass predictions for actual-fail samples）。\"\n      - \"ECE bar chart: 4 models × exception_only + Qwen-7B no_trace/full_trace/VOTA 作对照。exception_only 的 bar 在所有模型上极短（≤0.008），no_trace bar (0.171) 显著突出。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model calibration 确认 exception signal 的 calibration 优势是 universal property\n      而非 Qwen-specific artifact。论文可 claim：'exception_only achieves near-perfect calibration\n      (ECE ≤ 0.008) across 4 architecturally distinct models, a 21-86× improvement over\n      no-trace baselines'。DeepSeek seed123 outlier 是 LoRA initialization problem 而非\n      calibration 本身的 issue——将其纳入 D9 (LoRA sensitivity) 讨论即可。关键论文价值：\n      calibration 是独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension，审稿人难以 dismiss——即使觉得 99.83%\n      可能 saturated，ECE/Brier 提供模型 'knows what it knows' 的定量证据。建议作为 Table 2\n      或 Figure 3 纳入正文（非 appendix），与 accuracy table 并列。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_020: Few-shot prompting baseline — frontier models\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"few_shot_frontier_baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"GPT-4o/Claude 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\"\n    expected_results:\n      # exception_only trace input\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception_only: 0.945\n      gpt4o_0shot_exception_only_ci: [0.93, 0.96]\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception_only: 0.965\n      gpt4o_3shot_exception_only_ci: [0.95, 0.98]\n      claude_0shot_exception_only: 0.935\n      claude_0shot_exception_only_ci: [0.92, 0.95]\n      claude_3shot_exception_only: 0.960\n      claude_3shot_exception_only_ci: [0.945, 0.975]\n      # no_trace input (supplementary)\n      gpt4o_3shot_no_trace: 0.835\n      claude_3shot_no_trace: 0.820\n      # SFT comparison\n      sft_qwen7b_exception_only: 0.9983\n      sft_advantage_vs_best_fewshot_pp: 3.3\n      sft_qwen15b_exception_only: 0.9983\n      sft_1_5b_vs_gpt4o_3shot_pp: 3.3\n      # Cost comparison (per 1190 samples)\n      gpt4o_api_cost_usd: 2.5\n      sft_inference_cost_usd: 0.01\n      cost_ratio: 250\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4o 和 Claude 是 frontier models，zero-shot code reasoning 能力极强。给定 exception_only\n      traces，task 简化为 'if [ERROR] tags present → likely fail; if no errors → likely pass'。\n      Frontier models 0-shot 能处理大部分 cases (94-95%)，剩余 5-6% 错误来自：\n      (1) GeneratorExit 等 non-fatal exceptions（frontier models 也会被 [ERROR] tag 误导，\n      与 SFT 相同）；(2) 边界情况如 partial exceptions、多个 exception types 混合；\n      (3) 对 no_exception format marker 的不一致解读（有时将空 trace 误判为 incomplete\n      information 而非 no-fault signal）。\n      3-shot 提升 ~2pp（GPT-4o: 94.5→96.5%, Claude: 93.5→96%），exemplars 帮助建立\n      consistent decision boundary，但无法达到 SFT 水平——SFT 通过 4720 训练样本学到了\n      dataset-specific patterns（哪些 exception types always fatal, 哪些 benign），few-shot\n      的 3 个 exemplars 无法覆盖这些 long-tail patterns。\n      关键发现：SFT Qwen-1.5B (1.5B params, 99.83%) 以 3.3pp 优势超越 GPT-4o 3-shot\n      (>175B params, 96.5%)——task-specific SFT 在 verdict prediction 上的参数效率是 generic\n      reasoning 的 >100×。但 3.3pp gap 在审稿人眼中可能是 'modest'——需要强调 error count\n      差异（2 vs ~42 errors, ~21× difference）和 cost 差异（250×）。\n      GPT-4o 3-shot no_trace (83.5%) vs SFT no_trace (75.1%) 的对比说明 frontier model\n      的代码理解能力可以部分替代 trace 信息——但远不如 SFT + exception_only (99.83%)。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"SFT vs Frontier Few-shot Comparison\"\n        headers: [Method, Model, Input, Accuracy, Errors/1190, \"Cost ($)\", Latency]\n        rows:\n          - [SFT, Qwen-7B, exception_only, \"99.83%\", 2, \"~$0.01\", \"~2s batch\"]\n          - [SFT, Qwen-1.5B, exception_only, \"99.83%\", 2, \"~$0.005\", \"~1s batch\"]\n          - [3-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, \"96.5%\", \"~42\", \"~$2.50\", \"~15min serial\"]\n          - [3-shot, Claude, exception_only, \"96.0%\", \"~48\", \"~$3.00\", \"~18min serial\"]\n          - [0-shot, GPT-4o, exception_only, \"94.5%\", \"~65\", \"~$1.80\", \"~12min serial\"]\n          - [0-shot, Claude, exception_only, \"93.5%\", \"~77\", \"~$2.20\", \"~14min serial\"]\n          - [3-shot, GPT-4o, no_trace, \"83.5%\", \"~196\", \"~$1.20\", \"~10min serial\"]\n      - title: \"Base Model Zero-shot vs Frontier Few-shot (contextualization)\"\n        headers: [Model, Params, 0-shot, 3-shot, SFT, \"SFT Δ vs 3-shot\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen-1.5B, 1.5B, \"93.45%\", \"—\", \"99.83%\", \"+6.4pp\"]\n          - [Qwen-7B, 7B, \"89.08%\", \"90.84%\", \"99.83%\", \"+9.0pp\"]\n          - [DeepSeek-7B, 6.7B, \"90.59%\", \"—\", \"99.33%\", \"+8.7pp\"]\n          - [GPT-4o, \">175B\", \"94.5%\", \"96.5%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Claude, \">175B\", \"93.5%\", \"96.0%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by method (SFT exception_only × 4 models, 0-shot × 5 models, 3-shot × 2 frontier models)。SFT bars 在 99%+ 区域，few-shot bars 在 90-97% 区域，清晰展示 SFT advantage。\"\n      - \"Cost-accuracy Pareto plot: x-axis = log(cost per 1190 samples), y-axis = accuracy。SFT 在左上角 (low cost, high accuracy), frontier few-shot 在右下 (high cost, lower accuracy)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Few-shot baseline 确认两个论文论点：(1) SFT exception_only 在 verdict task 上超越\n      frontier model few-shot 3-5pp，证明 task-specific fine-tuning 的价值——尤其 1.5B SFT\n      model 超越 >175B GPT-4o 的 result 有很强 narrative appeal；(2) 即使 frontier model\n      也从 exception traces 获益 (no_trace 83.5% → exception_only 96.5%, +13pp)，independent\n      confirm Claim 2 的 information density 论点。但 median 档下 gap 仅 3.3pp，审稿人可能\n      argue 'the gap is not practically significant given the cost of SFT'。Rebuttal：\n      (a) error count 差异是 21×（2 vs 42），在 safety-critical 场景下差异巨大；\n      (b) SFT inference cost 是 few-shot 的 1/250；(c) SFT model 可 offline deploy 无需\n      API access。建议作为 Section 5 的 comparison table 纳入正文，定位为 'SFT as practical\n      deployment recommendation' 而非 'SFT is fundamentally superior'。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_021: OOD generalization — cross-language traces\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"ood_generalization_cross_language\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"不同编程语言/项目的 trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\"\n    expected_results:\n      # Python OOD (different projects, not HumanEval/MBPP)\n      python_ood_exception_only_accuracy: 0.965\n      python_ood_exception_only_ci: [0.945, 0.980]\n      python_ood_degradation_vs_id_pp: 3.3\n      # Java traces\n      java_exception_only_accuracy: 0.920\n      java_exception_only_ci: [0.895, 0.945]\n      java_degradation_vs_id_pp: 7.8\n      # JavaScript traces\n      javascript_exception_only_accuracy: 0.905\n      javascript_exception_only_ci: [0.875, 0.930]\n      javascript_degradation_vs_id_pp: 9.3\n      # Cross-language mean\n      cross_language_mean_accuracy: 0.930\n      cross_language_mean_degradation_pp: 6.8\n      # Baseline comparisons on OOD\n      python_ood_no_trace_accuracy: 0.720\n      java_no_trace_accuracy: 0.680\n      javascript_no_trace_accuracy: 0.670\n      exception_only_lift_over_no_trace_ood_mean_pp: 24.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Exception_only 的 OOD generalization 依赖于 exception signal 的 cross-language\n      structural similarity。核心假设：[ERROR] type: ... message: ... 格式是 tracer\n      output 的 design choice，不是 language-inherent property——但不同语言的 exception\n      type naming 和 error message conventions 不同，导致 distribution shift。\n      Python OOD (96.5%)：同语言不同项目，exception types（TypeError, ValueError, IndexError）\n      与训练集分布相似，仅 project-specific custom exceptions 造成少量降级。3.3pp degradation\n      主要来自 (1) 训练集未见过的 custom exception classes, (2) 不同项目的 test structure\n      差异（多文件、fixtures）。\n      Java (92.0%)：exception structure 类似（try-catch, stack traces）但 exception type\n      names 不同（NullPointerException, ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException 等 Java-specific names\n      训练集中未出现）。模型仍能利用 [ERROR] tag 的 binary signal，但对 exception type 的\n      fine-grained 理解降级。7.8pp degradation。\n      JavaScript (90.5%)：最大降级。JS 的 error handling 差异更大（Promise rejection, TypeError\n      in async context），且 error message format 与 Python 差异最大。但 [ERROR] tag 的\n      presence/absence signal 仍 partially transferable。9.3pp degradation。\n      所有语言上 exception_only 仍大幅优于 no_trace（mean lift 24.3pp），证明 exception\n      signal 的 fault detection value 跨语言 robust，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"OOD Generalization: exception_only across Languages\"\n        headers: [Language, Setting, exception_only, no_trace, Lift, \"Degradation vs in-domain\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Python, In-domain (HumanEval+MBPP), \"99.83%\", \"75.1%\", \"+24.7pp\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [Python, OOD (new projects), \"96.5%\", \"72.0%\", \"+24.5pp\", \"-3.3pp\"]\n          - [Java, OOD, \"92.0%\", \"68.0%\", \"+24.0pp\", \"-7.8pp\"]\n          - [JavaScript, OOD, \"90.5%\", \"67.0%\", \"+23.5pp\", \"-9.3pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: languages × conditions (exception_only vs no_trace)。每种语言两个 bar，展示 exception_only 的 lift 在 OOD 上保持稳定 (~24pp)，即使 absolute accuracy 降级。\"\n      - \"Degradation waterfall: in-domain → Python OOD → Java → JavaScript，展示 progressive degradation 但 floor 仍 >90%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OOD 结果是 median 档最大风险实验。Python OOD 降级温和 (3.3pp) 支持 generalization\n      claim。Java/JavaScript 降级更大 (8-9pp) 但 (1) 仍优于所有 baseline conditions，\n      (2) lift over no_trace 保持稳定 (~24pp)——说明 exception signal 的 fault detection\n      value 跨语言 transferable，但 absolute accuracy 受 token-level distribution shift\n      影响。论文 framing：'exception_only generalizes within-language with minimal degradation\n      (3pp) and cross-language with moderate degradation (8-9pp); the diagnostic signal\n      advantage is preserved (24pp lift) regardless of language'。审稿人可能 argue\n      'Java/JS 降 8-9pp 说明 signal 不是 truly language-agnostic'——rebuttal：降级来自\n      exception type vocabulary shift 而非 signal mechanism change；用 language-mixed\n      training 可恢复。此实验的最大价值：如果完成，将 single-task concern 从 1 task → 1 task\n      多语言，部分回应 scope criticism。风险：如果 Java/JS 降到 <85%，narrative 受损。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_022: Training dynamics — learning curve comparison\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"training_dynamics_learning_curves\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"exception_only vs full_trace 每 50 steps eval，分析收敛速度差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      # exception_only convergence\n      exception_only_steps_to_90pct: 30\n      exception_only_steps_to_95pct: 50\n      exception_only_steps_to_99pct: 120\n      exception_only_final_accuracy: 0.9983\n      exception_only_curve_shape: monotonic_rapid_saturation\n      # VOTA convergence\n      vota_steps_to_90pct: 60\n      vota_steps_to_95pct: 100\n      vota_steps_to_99pct: 180\n      vota_final_accuracy: 0.9941\n      vota_curve_shape: monotonic_moderate_saturation\n      # full_trace convergence\n      full_trace_steps_to_80pct: 150\n      full_trace_peak_accuracy: 0.830\n      full_trace_peak_step: 200\n      full_trace_final_accuracy: 0.8176\n      full_trace_curve_shape: non_monotonic_with_dip\n      # no_trace convergence\n      no_trace_steps_to_73pct: 80\n      no_trace_plateau_accuracy: 0.751\n      no_trace_curve_shape: rapid_plateau_low_ceiling\n      # Relative speed ratios\n      speed_ratio_exception_vs_vota_to_95pct: 2.0\n      speed_ratio_exception_vs_full_trace_to_80pct: 5.0\n      # Convergence efficiency\n      exception_only_samples_per_pp_gain: 8.5\n      full_trace_samples_per_pp_gain: 72.0\n      efficiency_ratio: 8.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Training dynamics 直接测量 information density 对 learning efficiency 的影响。\n      Exception_only 收敛最快（~50 steps to 95%）因为：(1) input 极短（平均 <100 tokens），\n      gradient 完全集中在 verdict-relevant signal 上；(2) 有效 unique 样本仅 2858，但 signal\n      的 binary structure（有 exception → fail，无 exception → pass）极其 learnable，少量\n      样本即可学会；(3) 无 noise tokens 干扰，每一步训练都是 effective update。\n      Full_trace 收敛最慢且 non-monotonic：(1) 长 input（mean ~2000 tokens）导致 gradient\n      dilution——大部分 gradient 流向 trace token 预测而非 verdict signal；(2) epoch1 peak\n      (83.0%) 后 epoch2 下降 (76.3%) 说明模型 overfits to trace patterns 而非 verdict\n      signal；(3) epoch3 partial recovery (81.76%) 可能是 overfitting 的 random fluctuation\n      而非 systematic learning。\n      VOTA 介于两者之间：input 长度中等，包含 Tier 1 + Tier 2 信号，前者快速学习，后者需要\n      更多 steps 但不会严重干扰。\n      No_trace 快速饱和在低水平（~75%），因为无 trace 信号可学习，模型只能学习 code→verdict\n      的弱统计相关性。\n      Convergence efficiency ratio (~8.5×) 是 information density 假说的 direct quantification：\n      exception_only 每 pp gain 需要 ~8.5 training samples，full_trace 需要 ~72——验证\n      'denser signal → faster learning' 的因果链。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Convergence Milestones (steps to reach accuracy threshold)\"\n        headers: [Condition, \"To 80%\", \"To 90%\", \"To 95%\", \"To 99%\", \"Final\", Shape]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, \"~20\", \"~30\", \"~50\", \"~120\", \"99.83%\", \"Rapid saturation\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~30\", \"~60\", \"~100\", \"~180\", \"99.41%\", \"Moderate saturation\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~150\", \"never\", \"never\", \"never\", \"81.76%\", \"Non-monotonic\"]\n          - [no_trace, \"never\", \"never\", \"never\", \"never\", \"75.13%\", \"Low-ceiling plateau\"]\n      - title: \"Learning Efficiency Comparison\"\n        headers: [Condition, \"Effective unique samples\", \"Final lift (pp)\", \"Samples per pp\", Efficiency]\n        rows:\n          - [exception_only, 2858, 24.7, 8.5, \"1.0× (reference)\"]\n          - [VOTA, \"~5800\", 24.3, 17.5, \"0.49×\"]\n          - [full_trace, \"~5800\", 6.6, 71.8, \"0.12×\"]\n          - [no_trace, \"~5800\", 3.6, 131.7, \"0.06×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot (main figure): x-axis = training steps, y-axis = eval accuracy (%)。4 条 curves 用不同颜色/线型。exception_only 陡升后 flat（红色实线），VOTA 次之（蓝色实线），full_trace non-monotonic（绿色虚线），no_trace 低 plateau（灰色点线）。水平虚线标注 majority baseline (71.5%)。每 50 steps 一个评估点。\"\n      - \"Convergence speed bar chart: 4 conditions × steps to reach 90% (或 condition-specific ceiling 的 90%)，直观对比 learning speed。exception_only bar 最短。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Training dynamics 为 Claim 2 (information density) 提供 process-level evidence，补充\n      已有的 outcome-level evidence (accuracy comparison)。Key narrative：exception_only\n      不仅最终 accuracy 最高，learning efficiency 也最高——8.5× faster per-pp-gain than\n      full_trace，直接量化了 information density 的 learning advantage。full_trace 的\n      non-monotonic curve（epoch2 dip）进一步说明 information overload 不仅限制 ceiling，\n      还 destabilize training——与 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling) 呼应。\n      论文价值：作为 Figure 4 或 Supplementary Figure，与 budget curve (plan_016) 形成\n      互补——budget curve 展示 'how much trace to include'，training dynamics 展示 'how\n      efficiently different signals are learned'。不作独立 contribution，但作为 Claim 2\n      的 converging evidence 有价值。审稿人可能问 'is this just because exception_only\n      has shorter sequences?'——answer：shorter sequences + diagnostic signal concentration，\n      两者 confounded 但都支持 information density narrative。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e268a169-9390-4bcd-a3c2-7ca64c8e09ca","total_cost_usd":1.0688962499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41411,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":30708,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41411,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":30708,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41411},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":36372,"outputTokens":15,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.036447,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":30708,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":41411,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.03244925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"ccb89f14-5574-448c-9d2e-843a6125fa55"}
